# node WebSocket implementation. Forwards to the linked websocket runtime shim (global WebSocket). Declares the opaque handle type a socket holds (the raw WebSocket). Internal: reached only through the public WebSocket API.

dock type
  load <any>, name websocket-handle

dock load
  load <global:websocket>, name websocket

load @term/seed/code/network/websocket
  find socket

task do-connect
  note async
  take url, like text
  like socket
  save raw
    call websocket/connect
      read url
      wait true
  send back
    make socket
      bind dock, read raw
      bind url, read url
